cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this package, please cite it and the refractiveindex.info
  database paper (Polyanskiy 2024), and state the database version
  (refractiveindex.DATABASE_VERSION).
type: software
title: "refractiveindex: Python interface to the refractiveindex.info database"
abstract: >-
  Python interface to the refractiveindex.info database. Gives the refractive
  index, extinction coefficient and permittivity of optical materials. The
  database is included in the package.
authors:
  - family-names: Toftul
    given-names: Ivan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3588-5403"
  - name: "refractiveindex contributors"
    website: "https://github.com/toftul/refractiveindex/graphs/contributors"
version: 1.3.1
date-released: 2026-10-27
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23682585
repository-code: "https://github.com/toftul/refractiveindex"
keywords:
  - optics
  - refractive index
  - photonics
  - materials
  - refractiveindex.info
references:
